// Recovery: prescription, procedure, appeals (L.262-45/46/47,
// R.262-88/89/90/92/92-1/93/94).
//
// DEONTIC MAP: overpayments MUST be recovered by withholding from future
// amounts (lump-sum on the claimant's option); appeals and remission
// requests SUSPEND recovery; below 77 euros or time-barred, NO recovery;
// fraud carries a 10 % indemnity (2024+). The R.262-92-1 notification
// procedure runs from 2021-03-25 (B-RSA-RECOUVREMENT-PRE202103 for the
// January-February 2021 sliver); the one-month/two-month release clocks
// of R.262-92-1 II are fund-side time mechanics (README).

language "law.core" version "0.2";
